{"id":"664718","name":"牛肉炒豆芽菜","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/664718/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄牛肉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"黄豆芽","amount":"350g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"半匙"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉切薄片，用生粉、生抽、胡椒粉，腌制20分钟。","img":"images/664718/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆芽洗净备用。","img":"images/664718/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒入适量油，下牛肉片炒到6成熟，盛出备用。","img":"images/664718/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中倒入适量油，下豆芽翻炒。","img":"images/664718/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下入盐、鸡粉，翻炒一下。","img":"images/664718/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入少许清水，盖锅盖，中火焖煮3分钟。","img":"images/664718/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入牛肉片，翻炒一下。","img":"images/664718/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入辣椒粉，继续翻炒2分钟即可。","img":"images/664718/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}